# Interface number: 11509 = Classic Era 1.15.9 (last known build). TODO verify in
# game with  /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())  and replace the number above.

# Load order matters:
#  1. Locales     - string table (Pathwise.L)
#  2. Platform    - the only layer that calls flavor-specific WoW API
#  3. Core/Init   - namespace, saved variables, events, callbacks, commands
#  4. Data        - plain Lua tables for this flavor
#  5. Core        - logic modules (never call WoW API directly)
#  6. UI          - frames, popups, slash command binding

Locales\enUS.lua

Platform\Platform_Classic.lua

Core\Init.lua

UI\SlashCommands.lua
